SUMMARY:Island Magic Mike LIVE at San Jose Improv
DTSTAMP:20260817T033538Z
DTSTART:20260819T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nIsland Ma
	gic Mike\, born Mike Garcia\, is a stand-up comedian and content creator b
	orn and raised on the North Shore of O’ahu\, Hawaii. Known as the class cl
	own growing up\, Mike turned his natural gift for making people laugh into
	 a full-time career\, building a loyal fanbase through his hilarious and r
	elatable TikTok and Instagram skits. \nMike’s comedy is rooted in his Hawa
	iian upbringing\, island culture\, and the universal experiences of everyd
	ay life. His positive\, infectious energy is impossible to resist\, and hi
	s live shows leave audiences with big smiles and lasting memories. He has 
	sold out iconic Hawaiian venues including The Blue Note Hawaii and the Haw
	aii Theatre\, and has appeared in commercials and emceed numerous events a
	cross the islands. \nNow bringing his act to the mainland\, Island Magic M
	ike is making waves on the national comedy circuit. His warm\, high-energy
	 style is a refreshing change of pace\, and his San Jose Improv debut is n
	ot to be missed. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Wednesday\, August 19\, 2026\nSh
	ow Time: 8:00 PM PDT (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: San Jose Improv\, 62 
	S Second St\, San Jose\, CA 95113\nAge Restriction: 21+ Event – Valid ID r
	equired at the door\nContent: Stand-up comedy – warm\, high-energy\, and f
	ull of island spirit\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe San Jose Improv is the Bay Ar
	ea’s top stand-up comedy club\, located in the heart of downtown San Jose 
	at 62 S Second St. As part of the nationally renowned Improv comedy club c
	hain\, the venue has been a cornerstone of Silicon Valley’s comedy scene\,
	 hosting both rising stars and established headliners night after night. \
	nThe intimate club setting puts every audience member close to the stage\,
	 creating a warm and lively atmosphere that perfectly complements Island M
	agic Mike’s high-energy performance style. The venue offers a full bar and
	 dining menu\, with a mandatory two-item minimum per guest in the showroom
	. Seating is general admission and first-come\, first-served except for gr
	oups and premium booths\, so plan to arrive early. \nThe San Jose Improv i
	s easily accessible from downtown San Jose\, with multiple parking garages
	 and public transit options nearby. It is the perfect midweek destination 
	for a night of great laughs. \nWhat to Expect\nExpect a high-energy\, feel
	-good night of stand-up comedy that brings the spirit of Hawaii straight t
	o Silicon Valley. Island Magic Mike’s show is a solo headlining performanc
	e packed with stories from island life\, observations on mainland culture\
	, and the kind of infectious positivity that makes you feel like you just 
	got back from vacation. \nHis comedy is accessible and warm\, perfect for 
	a wide range of audiences. Whether you are already a fan from his viral so
	cial media content or discovering him for the first time\, you are in for 
	a treat. Mike’s stage presence is electric\, and his ability to connect wi
	th a crowd is something special. \nThis is a 21+ event. Bring your ID\, en
	joy the two-item minimum\, and get ready to laugh. No phones\, no photogra
	phy\, no recording during the show. Just pure aloha spirit and great comed
	y. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $25 – $90 (plus fees) \n\nGA Ticket:
	 $25 (plus fees)\nVIP Ticket: $40 (plus fees) – preferred seating\nGA Prem
	ium Table (seats 4): $75 (plus fees) – includes $200 food and beverage cre
	dit\nVIP Premium Banquette (seats 4): $90 (plus fees) – includes $200 food
	 and beverage credit\, premium viewing\n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \
	nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra 
	cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/island-magic-mike-live-at
	-san-jose-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/island-magic-mike-live-at-san-jose-imp
	rov/
LOCATION:San Jose Improv\, 62 S Second St\, San Jose\, California\, 95113\,
	 United States
