SUMMARY:Nikki Glaser: The Stunning Tour LIVE at Ovens Auditorium (Night 1)
DTSTAMP:20260817T033538Z
DTSTART:20260820T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nNikki Gla
	ser is one of the sharpest\, most fearless voices in stand-up comedy today
	. Known for her razor-sharp wit\, brutally honest self-deprecation\, and u
	napologetically bold humor\, Glaser has become one of the most talked-abou
	t comedians in the country. From her acclaimed Netflix specials to her vir
	al Golden Globes hosting performance\, Nikki Glaser is everywhere — and fo
	r good reason. \nHer 2026 Stunning Tour is her most ambitious stand-up run
	 yet\, selling out theaters across North America and Europe. Glaser’s come
	dy is equal parts confessional and confrontational — she goes places other
	 comedians won’t\, and she does it with a smile that makes you feel like y
	ou’re in on the joke. Expect material on relationships\, pop culture\, bod
	y image\, and the absurdity of modern life\, all delivered with her signat
	ure precision and charm. \nThis is Night 1 of a two-night stand in Charlot
	te. Whether you’re a longtime fan or new to Nikki Glaser\, this is a show 
	you won’t want to miss. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, August 20\, 20
	26\nDoors Open: 6:00 PM EDT\nShow Time: 7:00 PM EDT\nVenue: Ovens Auditori
	um\, 2900 E Independence Boulevard\, Charlotte\, NC 28205\nTicket Price Ra
	nge: $56 – $632+\nContent Warning: Adult language and mature themes\n\nAbo
	ut the Venue\nOvens Auditorium is one of Charlotte’s most beloved and stor
	ied performance venues\, located at 2900 E Independence Boulevard. With a 
	seating capacity of approximately 2\,600 guests\, it offers an intimate ye
	t grand theater experience with excellent sightlines from every section. \
	nThe venue features Orchestra\, Mezzanine\, and Balcony seating sections\,
	 all with clear views of the stage. Ovens Auditorium is managed by Blument
	hal Performing Arts and is known for its warm acoustics\, classic architec
	ture\, and the kind of close-to-the-performer atmosphere that makes live c
	omedy feel electric. \nParking is available on-site and in nearby lots alo
	ng E Independence Boulevard. The venue is easily accessible by car from Up
	town Charlotte and surrounding areas. Arrive early to find your seats and 
	settle in before showtime. \nWhat to Expect\nNikki Glaser’s Stunning Tour 
	is a solo stand-up performance featuring all-new material. Glaser is celeb
	rated for her ability to make audiences laugh at things they’d normally be
	 too embarrassed to admit they find funny — her comedy is cathartic\, conf
	essional\, and completely captivating. \nExpect a high-energy\, fast-paced
	 show with sharp punchlines\, unexpected tangents\, and the kind of crowd 
	energy that only comes from seeing a comedian at the absolute peak of thei
	r powers. Glaser’s stage presence is magnetic\, and her timing is impeccab
	le. \nThis is a solo headlining show. The show is expected to run approxim
	ately 75–90 minutes. Seating is reserved — arrive on time to settle in bef
	ore the lights go down. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from $56 to $6
	32+ depending on section and availability. Purchase official tickets direc
	tly through Ticketmaster\, or find resale tickets through VividSeats. \nOf
	ficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may 
	earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/e
	vent/nikki-glaser-the-stunning-tour-live-at-ovens-auditorium-night-one/\n\
	nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/nikki-glaser-the-stunning-tour-live-at
	-ovens-auditorium-night-one/
LOCATION:Ovens Auditorium\, 2900 E Independence Boulevard\, Charlotte\, NC\
	, 28205\, United States
