DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nLavell Crawford LIVE at Chicago Improv\nLavell Cra
	wford brings his legendary stand-up comedy to the Chicago Improv in Schaum
	burg for a night of non-stop laughs. Best known for his role as Huell on “
	Breaking Bad” and “Better Call Saul\,” Crawford is one of the most beloved
	 comedians working today\, delivering big laughs with his larger-than-life
	 personality. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 21\, 2026\nTime: 7:00
	 PM (Doors: 5:00 PM)\nVenue: Chicago Improv\nAddress: 5 Woodfield Mall K12
	0B\, Schaumburg\, IL 60173\nAge Requirement: 21+ (Valid ID required)\nSeat
	ing: General Admission (first-come\, first-served)\nMinimum: 2-item food/d
	rink minimum per person \nAbout Lavell Crawford\nLavell Crawford is a stan
	d-up comedian and actor best known for playing Huell Babineaux on AMC’s “B
	reaking Bad” and “Better Call Saul.” A veteran of the comedy circuit\, Cra
	wford has appeared on “Last Comic Standing” and released multiple stand-up
	 specials. His warm\, self-deprecating humor and infectious energy make hi
	m a fan favorite wherever he performs. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious self-
	deprecating stand-up comedy\nStories from his time on Breaking Bad and Bet
	ter Call Saul\nWarm\, crowd-pleasing humor for all comedy fans\nIntimate c
	omedy club atmosphere at Chicago Improv\nFull food and drink service (2-it
	em minimum)\n21+ event — valid photo ID required\n\nVenue Information\nChi
	cago Improv is located inside Woodfield Mall in Schaumburg\, IL\, one of t
	he premier comedy clubs in the Chicago area. The venue offers a full menu 
	and bar service in an intimate showroom setting perfect for live comedy. \
	nTicket Information\nTickets start at $39.77. Available through Ticketmast
	er and VividSeats. All sales are final. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets
	 \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchas
	e tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final.
	 Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n
	\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/lavell-crawford-live-at-chicago-improv/
	\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
